's session language","fullName":"tests.test_game_engine_lifecycle#test_start_game_builds_data_miner_with_session_language"},"descriptionHtml":"<p>DataMiner constructed during setting research must localise to the engine's session language.</p>\n<pre><code>Regression guard: earlier versions built the initial DataMiner with the default ``language=&quot;English&quot;``,\nso a Russian session received English setting data and every downstream agent's system prompt ended up\nlayered over an English summary. Cross-check against ``wire_director``'s ``data_miner or DataMiner(...)``\nshort-circuit — the pre-built instance wins, so it must be localised here at construction time.\n</code></pre>\n","environment":"default","setup":[{"id":"3828f4cc54c902f37a59fe77e552f88b","type":"before","name":"_install_log_scrubber","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"6b907cec3744b02fad5b104301a6a879","type":"before","name":"_function_scoped_runner","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":1},{"id":"bfdcb654098bdb822876deb4867d690f","type":"before","name":"event_loop_policy","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"cd43bf7db389155960ef27ebdbba2435","type":"before","name":"simple_setting","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0}],"teardown":[{"id":"a383a39f1e25245ba092c0655896969d","type":"after","name":"_install_log_scrubber::0","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"7cd85a84803df44d536b589cefaa3b02","type":"after","name":"_function_scoped_runner::0","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":1}],"history":[],"retries":[],"breadcrumbs":[["tests","test_game_engine_lifecycle"]],"retry":false,"titlePath":["tests","test_game_engine_lifecycle.py"],"retriesCount":0,"attachments":[{"link":{"used":true,"missed":false,"id":"bd2ba940ce0fd5febd38a33b2380fbb6","originalFileName":"4b6c9601-4292-4575-87cd-7679dfc84206-attachment.txt","ext":".txt","contentType":"text/plain","contentLength":68,"name":"log"},"type":"attachment"},{"link":{"used":true,"missed":false,"id":"7c6b7023